<title>USA: Sterling Electronics sets 5 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>Sterling Electronics sets 5 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterling Electronics Corp said on Tuesday its board of directors declared a five percent stock dividend on the company's outstanding shares.</p>
<p>The dividend would be paid on December 30 to shareholders of record on December 9, the company said.</p>
<p>The company has 6.7 million shares outstanding, it said.</p>
